---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="NI Commit Law"
  description="About: Notational Intelligence as Commit Law — OpenIE research study (draft). Readable paper + PDF + interactive figures."
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Paper 1 · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Notational Intelligence as Commit Law
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      System One decides in software. WCA decides whether the machine is allowed to move.
      This research study treats notational intelligence as <em class="text-brand-white not-italic">commit law</em>:
      gates, honesty grades, and frozen claim ledgers before any actuator path.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
      Status: research study · draft (not a final journal PDF). Interactive figures include
      <code class="text-brand-cyan">ni-3d-01</code> canvas orbit stub. Display grades stay honest (V0–V2 prototype).
      <span class="font-mono text-brand-amber">board_synth_claimed=false</span>.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/ni/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read paper → /papers/ni/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/ni.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/living/ni/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan border border-brand-cyan/30 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-cyan/10 transition-colors">
        Interactive figures
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 glass-card p-6 space-y-3">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Paths</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate"><span class="text-brand-cyan">/papers/ni/</span> → study prose</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate"><span class="text-brand-cyan">/pdfs/ni.pdf</span> → downloadable study PDF</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate"><span class="text-brand-cyan">/living/ni/</span> → interactive figures (not the paper)</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
